{"sections":[{"slug":"分解同调","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"分解同调"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">分解同调</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"分解同调"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">分解同调</span></strong> (factorization homology), <span lang=\"zh\">又叫</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">手性同调</span></strong> (chiral homology), <span lang=\"zh\">是将</span> $\\mathbb E_n$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">沿</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">维流形作张量积</span>”, <span lang=\"zh\">或更一般地将</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/E_M-算畴","text":"$\\mathbb E_M$-<span lang=\"zh\">算畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的代数在流形</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">上作</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">张量积</span>”.</p>\n<p>$n$ <span lang=\"zh\">维流形范畴上的任何具有局部性的自然构造都是某个</span> $\\mathbb E_n$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数的分解同调</span>.</p>\n<p>$S^1$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的分解同调即</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Hochschild同调","text":"Hochschild <span lang=\"zh\">同调</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">分解同调也可以理解为流形的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">同调群</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的推广</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">由</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Dold–Thom定理","text":"Dold–Thom <span lang=\"zh\">定理</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">空间的同调群是其</span> “$\\mathbb N$-<span lang=\"zh\">系数构形空间</span>” (<span lang=\"zh\">即空间生成的自由交换幺半群</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">的同伦群</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">而对于</span> $\\mathbb E_n$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span> $A$, <span lang=\"zh\">可构造标架流形</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> “$A$-<span lang=\"zh\">系数构形空间</span>”, <span lang=\"zh\">直观上标架提供了将</span> $\\mathbb E_n$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数的元素</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">相加</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的方法</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $\\mathsf{Mfd}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">为如下</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":": <span lang=\"zh\">其对象为</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">维光滑流形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">态射空间为光滑</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">嵌入</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的空间</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">注意不是光滑映射的空间</span>), "},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">结构为流形的不交并</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">注意这个结构不是</span> $\\mathsf{Mfd}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的余积</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">因为两个嵌入</span> $M_1\\to N$, $M_2\\to N$ <span lang=\"zh\">不一定能给出</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">嵌入</span></strong> $M_1\\sqcup M_2\\to N$).</p>\n<h3>$\\mathbb E_n$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数的分解同调</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $(\\mathcal C,\\otimes)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半∞-范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为其中的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/En-代数","text":"$\\mathbb E_n$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">回忆</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/En-代数","text":"$\\mathbb E_n$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/语法–语义对偶","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">语法范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">为</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">标架</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">圆盘范畴</span>” $\\mathsf{Disk}_n^{\\mathrm{fr}}$ (<span lang=\"zh\">其对象为若干个</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">圆盘的无交并</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">态射为保持标架的光滑嵌入</span>). <span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>, $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/En-算畴","text":"$\\mathbb E_n$"}},{"Plain":"-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">等同于对称幺半函子</span>\n$$\r\n    A\\colon \\mathsf{Disk}_n^{\\mathrm{fr}} \\to \\mathcal C.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">现在设</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">是带</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/切结构","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">标架</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">维光滑流形</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">考虑范畴</span>\n$(\\mathsf{Disk}_n^{\\mathrm{fr}})_{/M}$,\n<span lang=\"zh\">其对象为嵌入</span> $\\sqcup_k  \\mathbb{R}^n \\hookrightarrow M$, <span lang=\"zh\">态射为包含关系</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">分解同调</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">为</span>\n$$\r\n\\int_M A := \\operatorname{colim}_{(\\mathsf{Disk}_n^{\\mathrm{fr}})_{/M}} A^{\\otimes k}= \\operatorname{colim}_{\\sqcup_k  \\mathbb{R}^n \\hookrightarrow M}\r\nA^{\\otimes k}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">那么分解同调函子</span>\n$$\r\n\\int_{-}A \\colon \\mathsf{Mfd}_{n}^{\\mathrm{fr}} \\to \\mathcal C\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">沿</span> $\\mathsf{Disk}_n^{\\mathrm{fr}} \\hookrightarrow \\mathsf{Mfd}_n^{\\mathrm{fr}}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Kan扩张","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">左</span> Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3>$\\mathbb E_M$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数的分解同调</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">固定流形</span> $M$, <span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $\\mathsf{Disk}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathsf{Mfd}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">中由</span> $S\\times\\mathbb{R}^n$ ($S$ <span lang=\"zh\">为有限集</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">构成的全子范畴</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">有一个直观的函子</span> $(\\mathsf{Disk}_n)_{/M} \\to \\mathbb E_M^\\otimes$ (<span lang=\"zh\">后者是指</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/E_M-算畴","text":"$\\mathbb E_M$-<span lang=\"zh\">算畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">作为</span> $\\mathsf{Fin}_{*}$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的纤维范畴的全空间</span>.) <span lang=\"zh\">这个函子允许我们对</span> $\\mathbb{E}_M$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span> $\\mathcal{A}$ <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> $U\\in (\\mathsf{Disk}_n)_{/M}$ <span lang=\"zh\">谈论</span> $\\mathcal{A}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> “$U$ <span lang=\"zh\">分量</span>” $\\mathcal{A}(U)$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/筛余极限","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">筛余极限</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal O$, <span lang=\"zh\">可构造分解同调</span>\n$$\r\n\\int_M \\colon \\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathbb E_M}(\\mathcal O) \\to \\mathcal O,\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\int_M \\mathcal A := \\operatorname{colim}_{U\\in (\\mathsf{Disk}_n)_{/M}} \\mathcal A (U).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">切除性</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">结构</span> $\\otimes$ <span lang=\"zh\">保持每个分量的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/筛余极限","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">筛余极限</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">那么对于</span> $\\mathbb E_n$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span> $A$,\n$$\r\n\\int_{-}A\\colon \\mathsf{Mfd}_n^{\\text{fr}} \\to\\mathcal C\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">是对称幺半函子</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">此时进一步有如下的</span> $\\otimes$-<strong><span lang=\"zh\">切除性</span></strong> (excision):\n<span lang=\"zh\">对于标架</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">流形的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">粘领口</span>” (collar-gluing) <span lang=\"zh\">分解</span>\n$$\r\n\tX=X_0\\cup_{W\\times\\mathbb{R}}X_1\r\n$$\n($X_0$, $X_1$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的开集</span>, $X_0\\cap X_1=W\\times\\mathbb{R}$), <span lang=\"zh\">有</span>\n$$\r\n\t\\int_X A \\simeq \\int_{X_0}A{\\bigotimes_{\\int_{W\\times\\mathbb{R} }A}}\\int_{X_1}A.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中用到</span> $\\int_{W\\times\\mathbb{R}}A$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" (<span lang=\"zh\">因为有对称幺半函子</span> $W\\times -\\colon \\mathsf{Disk}_1^{\\text{fr}} \\to \\mathsf{Mfd}_n^{\\text{fr}}$), <span lang=\"zh\">且</span> $\\int_{X_0}A$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\int_{W\\times \\mathbb{R}}A$-<span lang=\"zh\">右模</span>\n(<span lang=\"zh\">这是因为领口可以再加一个领口</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">两个领口可以合成一个领口</span>).</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">例</span>: $S^1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的分解同调</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">由于</span> $S^1$ <span lang=\"zh\">可以写成</span>\n$$\r\nS^1 = \\mathbb{R} \\cup_{S^0\\times\\mathbb{R}} \\mathbb{R},\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">对任意</span> $\\mathbb E_1$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":") $A$, <span lang=\"zh\">切除性给出一个等价</span>\n$$\r\n\\int_{S^1}A\\simeq A\\otimes_{A^{\\mathrm{op}}\\otimes A}A.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">这便是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Hochschild同调","text":"Hochschild <span lang=\"zh\">同调</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的一种定义</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}